---
import RatedBadge from "../components/RatedBadge.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Our Story | Otter Homecare" description="How Otter Homecare began — and the values that guide us.">
<header class="phero"><div class="wrap"><div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> · About · Our Story</div><h1>It started with caring for my own father</h1><p>Otter Homecare was founded from personal experience and a deep belief in compassionate, family-centred care.</p></div></header>
<section class="section founder"><div class="wrap"><div class="pic reveal"><img src="/img/founder-dad.jpg" alt="Jamie, our founder, with his father"></div><div class="reveal"><h2>Why I started Otter Homecare</h2><blockquote>After growing up in Wiltshire, I spent my twenties and thirties in Thailand — a culture where caring for older loved ones at home, surrounded by family, was simply the way of life. When I returned and my father suffered a severe stroke, it felt only natural to care for him at home, surrounded by familiar faces, dignity and love. Supervising his support team opened my eyes to the real power of empathetic, human-focused care — not just for the person being supported, but for the whole family. Otter Homecare grew from that.</blockquote><div class="sig">Jamie Rowland-Jones<span>Founder, Otter Homecare</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section bg-sky" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:520px;text-align:center"><img src="/img/jamie-thailand.png" alt="Jamie in Thailand" style="display:block;width:100%;border-radius:var(--r-lg);box-shadow:var(--shadow)" loading="lazy"><p style="margin-top:14px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);font-style:italic">Jamie in Thailand — where caring for older loved ones at home, surrounded by family, is simply a way of life.</p></div></section>

<section class="section bg-beige tmt"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;text-align:center"><div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Our mission</span><h2 style="font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);margin:10px 0 0">To deliver care rooted in kindness, respect and compassion — bringing comfort, trust and connection into homes across Wiltshire and Somerset.</h2></div></div></section>
<section class="section "><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px"><div class="head-c reveal"><span class="eyebrow">In Jamie's words</span><h2>Why I started Otter Homecare</h2></div><div class="video-embed reveal" data-yt="XDrJalkjfkg" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Play video: Why I started Otter Homecare"><img src="/img/poster-our-story.jpg" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://img.youtube.com/vi/XDrJalkjfkg/hqdefault.jpg'" alt="Jamie, founder of Otter Homecare, speaking to camera" loading="lazy"><span class="playbtn"><span></span></span><span class="vlabel">Watch: Why I started Otter</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section bg-sky tmt otterwhy"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:940px;text-align:center"><div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Why “Otter”?</span><h2>Why we’re called Otter</h2><p class="lede" style="max-width:58ch;margin:10px auto 0">Otters famously hold hands so they never drift apart — and they embody the very qualities we look for in every Care Professional.</p></div><div class="otter-habitat reveal"><div class="th-col"><figure class="trait-bubble point-right"><figcaption class="tb-name">I'm Adaptable</figcaption><p class="tb-text">Otters are equally at home on land and in water — just as our Care Professionals adapt and tailor their support to fit each person, and each day.</p></figure><figure class="trait-bubble point-right"><figcaption class="tb-name">I'm Playful &amp; positive</figcaption><p class="tb-text">Otters are famously playful. A shared laugh, a little fun and warm company often turn an ordinary visit into the best part of someone's day.</p></figure></div><div class="otter-scene"><img class="otter-mascot" src="/img/otter-mascot-full.png" alt="The Otter Homecare mascot" loading="lazy"></div><div class="th-col"><figure class="trait-bubble point-left"><figcaption class="tb-name">I'm Caring</figcaption><p class="tb-text">Otters keep their little ones close and warm. Our team brings that same devotion to looking after someone else's loved one, every single visit.</p></figure><figure class="trait-bubble point-left"><figcaption class="tb-name">I'm Protective</figcaption><p class="tb-text">Otters hold hands so they never drift apart. We watch over the people in our care just as closely — keeping them safe, secure and never alone.</p></figure></div></div></div><div class="river-full" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 1200 130" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0,46 C220,18 430,18 640,40 C840,60 1020,64 1200,36 L1200,130 L0,130 Z" fill="#88adb4"></path><path d="M0,70 C220,44 430,44 640,64 C840,82 1020,86 1200,60 L1200,130 L0,130 Z" style="fill:var(--teal-d)"></path></svg></div></section>
<section class="section tmt teal-panel"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px"><div class="head-c reveal"><span class="eyebrow">The people behind Otter</span><h2>Hands-on, by choice</h2></div><div class="reveal" style="max-width:64ch;margin:0 auto"><p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:14px">Jamie didn't come from care; he came from business — and chose to train properly into it.</p><p style="margin-bottom:14px">He's completing a <strong>Level 5 Diploma in Leadership for Health &amp; Social Care</strong>, is Train-the-Trainer qualified, and still personally delivers the values part of every new starter's induction. Leading by example, not from a desk.</p><p><strong>The gap we're here to fill.</strong> There are still very few genuinely outstanding home-care providers across West Wiltshire and Somerset. We're determined to be one of them — and to raise the bar locally for what good care looks like.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:900px;text-align:center"><div class="head-c reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Our values</span><h2>Kindness, Initiative, Learning &amp; Teamwork</h2><p class="lede" style="max-width:54ch;margin:10px auto 0">The four values that guide everyone at Otter — KILT, for short. It's the reason our otter wears a kilt.</p></div><div class="promise-row" style="text-align:left;margin-top:24px"> <div class="promise-otter reveal"> <div class="promise-bubble" id="kiltBubble"><span class="kb-in"><span class="kb-label" style="display:none"></span><span class="kb-quote">That's why I wear the kilt!</span></span></div> <img src="/assets/otter-kilt.png" alt="The Otter Homecare mascot wearing a tartan kilt — a nod to our four values: Kindness, Initiative, Learning, Teamwork" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="promise-list reveal"> <div class="pl"><span class="pl-val"><span class="ini">K</span>indness</span><div class="pl-body"><h3>Care that feels like family</h3><p>Care Professionals matched to your loved one for genuine warmth and patience — every single visit.</p></div></div> <div class="pl"><span class="pl-val"><span class="ini">I</span>nitiative</span><div class="pl-body"><h3>Always going the extra mile</h3><p>We take the initiative — spotting what would help and acting on it, from a thoughtful extra touch to smart tools like our Care App.</p></div></div> <div class="pl"><span class="pl-val"><span class="ini">L</span>earning</span><div class="pl-body"><h3>A team that keeps getting better at caring for you</h3><p>Directly employed Care Professionals, properly trained and always improving how they support you.</p></div></div> <div class="pl"><span class="pl-val"><span class="ini">T</span>eamwork</span><div class="pl-body"><h3>A reliable team around your loved one</h3><p>A small, familiar group who know your routine — never just one person, never a stranger.</p></div></div> </div> </div></div></section>
<script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var kb = document.getElementById("kiltBubble");
      if (!kb || window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches) return;
      var kq = [
        ["", "That's why I wear the kilt!"],
        ["Kindness", "We keep each other warm."],
        ["Initiative", "We go the extra mile."],
        ["Learning", "We never stop getting better."],
        ["Teamwork", "No otter floats alone."],
      ];
      var ki = 0;
      setInterval(function () {
        ki = (ki + 1) % kq.length;
        kb.classList.add("fade");
        setTimeout(function () {
          var lab = kb.querySelector(".kb-label");
          lab.textContent = kq[ki][0];
          lab.style.display = kq[ki][0] ? "block" : "none";
          kb.querySelector(".kb-quote").textContent = kq[ki][1];
          kb.classList.remove("fade");
        }, 360);
      }, 4200);
    })();
  </script>
<section class="section book"><div class="wrap" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;display:block;text-align:center"><div class="reveal" style="max-width:36ch;margin:0 auto"><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#9fc4bf">Free, no-obligation assessment</span><h2 style="margin:14px 0 12px">Let's find the right care, together</h2><p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:26px;color:#bfe0dc">Speak to a real, local person today — never a call centre.</p><div style="display:flex;gap:13px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-clay btn-lg" href="/contact">Book a free assessment</a><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="tel:01225690022" style="background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.5)">Call 01225 690022</a></div></div><div class="book-trust reveal"><div class="bt-ticks"><span>Free, no-obligation home visit</span><span>A care plan built around you</span><span>We usually reply the same day</span></div><RatedBadge /></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
